07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=siqaFr5Ys2cQ7kNvwE0nWDG&_nc_oc=AdrNwjNAnbsrHZT0VXHcxbp0ttmnliQ4cmWSIXP9mNNkDuqKfoq8-OEg_LVjKmlIG1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGmbT1e2sYn20EqoL4Zx8JHh0dKJIgxnRKrhTCrehKaw&oe=6A788C42"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p4G8zknSACgQ7kNvwFsYfKv&_nc_oc=AdqafwzD4SoOimlrN8U_xMZwesZcX4YgiCowrGu7B3VKrkHGecIPzGWjgh39d_HeJRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGN7xDPvS2p0aDOFEX_XEMHySKd4IpVSX_xuDdSyqFc1Q&oe=6A7881BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sWW2tjxlp6sQ7kNvwF6DWk2&_nc_oc=AdqAk37g_B-NedZRh8oHy0YvmwbPI1R7Y_X2bydC5gDgyL8_oCdEhhCvuuMGAzw8YWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEmeLX2jF-TaN9lpfNO04zw2bAliNooTXw6iByVtyMhfw&oe=6A7890B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic